Natural Earth
  Coasts, borders, states and provinces, lakes and rivers for the site map, https://www.naturalearthdata.com/.
  Public domain.

Planet positions
  JPL's "Keplerian Elements for Approximate Positions of the Major Planets" (E. M. Standish), public domain;
  magnitudes from Mallama & Hilton (2018).

